  "lyrics": "[Verse 1]\nYour street is quiet after twelve\nThe chippy pulls its shutter down\nYou walk me to the stop in socks\nAnd wave me off to cross the town\n\n[Chorus 1]\nI'll take the last bus back\nUpstairs for the whole ride\nTime stood still on your stairs\nAnd you're right by my side\n\n[Verse 2]\nI sit up top, the front left seat\nAnd breathe a circle, wipe the glass\nI write your name and rub it out\nAnd count the takeaways we pass\n\n[Chorus 2]\nI'll take the last bus back\nUpstairs for the whole ride\nTime stood still on your stairs\nAnd you're right by my side",
